flowchart LR
 U[React Dashboard] --> API[FastAPI API]
 API --> Q[Redis Queue]
 API --> DB[(MongoDB)]
 Q --> O[Scan Orchestrator]
 O --> C[Playwright Crawler]
 C --> E[Evidence Builder\nDOM CSS AX tree screenshots traces]
 E --> A[axe-core]
 E --> P[Custom Probes\nkeyboard focus contrast labels]
 A --> N[Finding Normalizer\nWCAG mapping + dedupe]
 P --> N
 N --> G{Vision escalation?}
 G -->|No| D[Adjudicator]
 G -->|Yes| V[Vision-LLM\nstructured JSON]
 V --> D
 D --> F[(Findings)]
 F --> L[LangGraph Remediation]
 L --> S[Typed Strategy]
 S --> X[Patch Validator + Diff]
 X --> H{Approval?}
 H -->|Reject| R[Human Review]
 H -->|Approve| B[Disposable Sandbox]
 B --> W[Verification Runner\nreplay + rescan]
 W --> K[Before/After + Regression Gate]
 K --> T[Report / Export]
 T --> API
 K -->|retry once| L
 K -->|rollback| B
 C --> OBJ[(Object Storage)]
 E --> OBJ
 B --> OBJ
